** {n:Sheelala} - {@i:Yagudo Drink|4558} {i:Yagudo Drink|Yagudo Drink|4558} - ({p:Curio Vendor Moogle} or {@g:Auction House} > Food > Meals > Drinks)
** {n:Habida-Jubida} - {@i:Dream Fl. Petal|4090} {i:Dream Flower Petal|Dream Fl. Petal|4090} - ({@g:Auction House} > Materials > Alchemy 1)
