>Obtaining a {@i:Wh. Rolanberry|6604} White Rolanberry
{n:Pellio} in {z:Rolanberry Fields} at (F-11) exchanges {@i:Rolanberry 854|6603} {i:Rolanberry 854s|Rolanberry 854|6603} for {@i:Wh. Rolanberry|6604} White Rolanberries.
* Fastest way to reach Pellio is the {z:Crawler's Nest} {p:Survival Guide} warp, then immediately exit to Rolanberry Fields.
* When traded a {@i:Rolanberry 854|6603} {i:Rolanberry 854|Rolanberry 854|6603}, he will reward you with either a {@i:Wh. Rolanberry|6604} {i:White Rolanberry|White Rolanberry|6604} or {@i:Ri. Wh. Rolan.|6605} {i:Ripe White Rolanberry|Ripe White Rolanberry|6605}.
** The chance for getting either the NQ or the HQ White Rolanberry is an equal 50:50.

>**Pellio will not accept a Rolanberry 854 until after the cutscene where Kupipi mentions the White Rolanberry.**
----
* Return to {n:Kupipi} and trade her either a {@i:Wh. Rolanberry|6604} {i:White Rolanberry|White Rolanberry|6604} or {@i:Ri. Wh. Rolan.|6605} {i:Ripe White Rolanberry|Ripe White Rolanberry|6605} for a cutscene.
** The cutscene dialogue is slightly different based on which Rolanberry you bring. The cutscene you would receive by bringing a {i:Ripe White Rolanberry|Ripe White Rolanberry|6605} can be viewed via {n:Mashua} near the fountain. It is called **Kupipi's Dilemma (pt.3)** under Additional Stories.
* Speak to {p:Shantotto} in {z:Windurst Walls} (K-7) for the final cutscene and your reward of 20,000 {p:Gil}.
** You may not receive the title automatically by completing the Mission, but you should still unlock it. You can verify that it is obtained by speaking to {n:Burute-Sorute} in {z:Windurst Walls} at (H-10), and look under the 400 {p:Gil} option.

